# Builtins the compiler registers that resolve to no runtime symbol directly.
#
# Classification is EMPIRICAL: each was compiled in a one-line program and the
# link either succeeded or reported `undefined reference'. Do not edit a status
# by inspection -- re-probe it.
#
# OK       = links (handled by codegen, or emitted under a name this script
#            cannot statically derive)
# PHANTOM  = typechecks, emits a call, fails at ld with no source location
#
# Measured 2026-09-16 against seed f242533f / runtime 8313e77e.
#
# name                       status
